        <p class="m-0 font-mono text-xs font-semibold text-accentink md:text-[13px]">how it works</p>
        <h2 class="m-0 mb-1.5 text-[32px] leading-[1.1] font-extrabold tracking-[-1px] md:mb-0 md:text-[46px] md:leading-normal md:tracking-[-1.4px]">Everything a first job throws at you.</h2>
      </div>

      <div
        id="bento"
        role="region"
        aria-label="How it works"
        class="-mx-4 flex snap-x snap-mandatory scroll-pl-4 gap-3 overflow-x-auto px-4 pt-0.5 pb-1 [scrollbar-width:none] md:mx-0 md:grid md:grid-cols-3 md:gap-[18px] md:overflow-visible md:p-0 [&::-webkit-scrollbar]:hidden"
      >
        <article class="flex w-[300px] flex-none snap-start flex-col gap-[18px] overflow-hidden rounded-[20px] border border-line bg-surface p-5 md:col-span-2 md:w-auto md:p-[26px]">
          <div class="flex flex-col gap-1.5">
            <h3 class="m-0 text-[19px] font-extrabold tracking-[-0.3px]">Real labs on your laptop</h3>
            <p class="m-0 text-[15px] leading-[1.55] text-fg2">
              <span class="md:hidden">dojo start breaks a machine for you. Your terminal, your editor.</span>
              <span class="hidden md:inline">dojo start breaks a machine for you. Your terminal, your editor, Windows, macOS or Linux.</span>
            </p>
          </div>
          <Terminal
            title="irene@laptop: ~/dojo, zsh"
            label="Terminal: dojo start support-l1/perms-03 boots a lab in 48 seconds, then dojo ssh opens a shell on the broken machine."
            bodyClass="text-[11px] md:text-xs"
          >
            <div><span class="text-[#6fcf97]">irene@laptop</span><span class="text-[#8c919b]">:</span><span class="text-[#8fa7f2]">~/dojo</span><span class="text-[#8c919b]">$ </span>dojo start support-l1/perms-03</div>
            <div class="text-[#b9bdc4]">Lab ready in 48s.</div>
            <div><span class="text-[#6fcf97]">irene@laptop</span><span class="text-[#8c919b]">:</span><span class="text-[#8fa7f2]">~/dojo</span><span class="text-[#8c919b]">$ </span>dojo ssh</div>
            <div class="hidden md:block"><span class="text-[#e8b04b]">root@lab-perms03</span><span class="text-[#8c919b]">:</span><span class="text-[#8fa7f2]">/srv</span><span class="text-[#8c919b]"># </span>ls -ld shared</div>
            <div class="hidden text-[#b9bdc4] md:block">drwxr-xr-x 2 root root shared</div>
            <div><span class="text-[#e8b04b]">root@lab-perms03</span><span class="text-[#8c919b]">:</span><span class="text-[#8fa7f2]">/srv</span><span class="text-[#8c919b]"># </span><span class="inline-block h-[15px] w-2 bg-[#e6e7e3] align-[-2px]"></span></div>
          </Terminal>
