            </p>
          </div>
          <div class="flex flex-col gap-2 text-sm leading-[1.45]">
            <div class="rounded-xl border border-line bg-surface px-3 py-2.5">
              <span class="font-mono text-xs font-bold text-accentink">hint 1</span><br />What does <span class="font-mono text-xs">ls -ld</span> say about the group?
            </div>
            <div class="rounded-xl border border-dashed border-line px-3 py-2.5 text-muted"><span class="font-mono text-xs">hint 2 · locked</span> the concept and its man page</div>
            <div class="rounded-xl border border-dashed border-line px-3 py-2.5 text-muted"><span class="font-mono text-xs">hint 3 · locked</span> a pointer, never the command</div>
          </div>
        </article>

        <article class="flex w-[300px] flex-none snap-start flex-col gap-[18px] overflow-hidden rounded-[20px] border border-line bg-surface p-5 md:w-auto md:p-[26px]">
          <div class="flex flex-col gap-1.5">
            <h3 class="m-0 text-[19px] font-extrabold tracking-[-0.3px]">Tickets from people</h3>
            <p class="m-0 text-[15px] leading-[1.55] text-fg2">
              <span class="md:hidden">Vague, grumpy or in capitals. Like real work.</span>
              <span class="hidden md:inline">Elena, Lucía and Javi. Vague, grumpy or in capitals. Like real work.</span>
            </p>
          </div>
          <div class="flex flex-col gap-2">
            <div class="flex items-center gap-2.5 rounded-xl border border-line px-3 py-2.5 text-[13px]">
              <span class="inline-flex size-7 flex-none items-center justify-center rounded-full bg-[#e9dccb] font-bold text-[#5a3e1e]" aria-hidden="true">E</span>
              <span class="min-w-0 truncate"><b>Elena</b> The team can't save files in /srv/shared</span>
            </div>
            <div class="flex items-center gap-2.5 rounded-xl border border-line px-3 py-2.5 text-[13px]">
              <span class="inline-flex size-7 flex-none items-center justify-center rounded-full bg-[#d5dce6] font-bold text-[#24364f]" aria-hidden="true">L</span>
              <span class="min-w-0 truncate"><b>Lucía</b> Disk on web-02 at 97% again.</span>
            </div>
            <div class="flex items-center gap-2.5 rounded-xl border border-line px-3 py-2.5 text-[13px]">
              <span class="inline-flex size-7 flex-none items-center justify-center rounded-full bg-[#ead3d0] font-bold text-[#6a2620]" aria-hidden="true">J</span>
              <span class="min-w-0 truncate"><b>Javi</b> THE NEW EMPLOYEE CANNOT LOG IN.</span>
            </div>
          </div>
        </article>

        <article class="flex w-[300px] flex-none snap-start flex-col gap-[18px] overflow-hidden rounded-[20px] border border-line bg-surface p-5 md:w-auto md:p-[26px]">
          <div class="flex flex-col gap-1.5">
            <h3 class="m-0 text-[19px] font-extrabold tracking-[-0.3px]">Paths, roles and belts</h3>
            <p class="m-0 text-[15px] leading-[1.55] text-fg2">
              <span class="md:hidden">A work-day exam per role. Belt marks for how you work.</span>
              <span class="hidden md:inline">A work-day exam at the end of each role. Belt marks for how you work.</span>
            </p>
          </div>
          <div class="flex flex-col gap-2">
            {belts.map((b) => (
              <div role="img" aria-label={`belt, ${b.marks} of 4 marks`} class={`box-border flex h-3.5 items-center justify-end gap-[3px] rounded px-[7px] ${b.bg}`}>
                {[0, 1, 2, 3].map((i) => (
                  <span class={`h-2 w-0.5 rounded-[1px] ${b.mark} ${i < b.marks ? '' : 'opacity-25'}`}></span>
                ))}
              </div>
            ))}
          </div>
        </article>

        <article class="flex w-[300px] flex-none snap-start flex-col gap-[18px] overflow-hidden rounded-[20px] border border-line bg-surface p-5 md:w-auto md:p-[26px]">
          <div class="flex flex-col gap-1.5">
            <h3 class="m-0 text-[19px] font-extrabold tracking-[-0.3px]">Quizzes, then a real exam</h3>
            <p class="m-0 text-[15px] leading-[1.55] text-fg2">
              <span class="md:hidden">Quizzes between tickets. A work-day exam per role: no hints, no AI.</span>
              <span class="hidden md:inline">Short quizzes check the ideas between tickets. Each role ends with a work day on a broken machine: no hints, no AI.</span>
            </p>
          </div>
          <div class="flex flex-col gap-2 text-[13px]">
            <div class="font-bold">Who logged in last night?</div>
            <div class="flex items-center gap-2.5 rounded-[10px] border border-line bg-surface px-2.5 py-2"><span class="font-mono text-xs">who</span></div>
            <div class="flex items-center gap-2.5 rounded-[10px] border border-ok bg-oksoft px-2.5 py-2">
              <span class="font-mono text-xs">last</span>
              <span class="ml-auto font-extrabold text-ok"><span aria-hidden="true">✓</span><span class="sr-only">Correct answer</span></span>
            </div>
            <div class="flex items-center gap-2.5 rounded-[10px] border border-line bg-surface px-2.5 py-2"><span class="font-mono text-xs">w</span></div>
          </div>
        </article>
      </div>

      <div data-controls class="invisible md:hidden">
        <div class="flex items-center justify-between">
          <div class="flex items-center gap-2">
            <button type="button" data-step="-1" class="inline-flex h-11 min-w-11 items-center justify-center rounded-[10px] border border-line bg-surface px-3 text-sm font-bold text-fg disabled:opacity-40">Previous</button>
            <button type="button" data-step="1" class="inline-flex h-11 min-w-11 items-center justify-center rounded-[10px] border border-line bg-surface px-3 text-sm font-bold text-fg disabled:opacity-40">Next</button>
          </div>
          <div class="flex items-center gap-3">
            <div class="flex gap-1.5" aria-hidden="true">
              {[0, 1, 2, 3, 4].map((i) => (
                <span data-dot class={`h-1.5 rounded-full ${i === 0 ? 'w-[18px] bg-accent' : 'w-1.5 bg-line'}`}></span>
              ))}
            </div>
            <span class="font-mono text-xs text-muted"><span data-pos>1</span> / 5 · swipe</span>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="mx-auto mt-10 max-w-[1180px] px-4 md:mt-[110px] md:px-6">
      <div class="flex flex-col gap-4 rounded-[22px] bg-fg px-[22px] py-7 text-bg md:flex-row md:items-center md:justify-between md:gap-8 md:rounded-[28px] md:p-14">
        <div class="flex flex-col gap-2.5">
          <h2 class="m-0 text-[28px] leading-[1.1] font-extrabold tracking-[-0.8px] md:text-[40px] md:leading-normal md:tracking-[-1.2px]">Support L1 is waiting.</h2>
          <p class="m-0 hidden text-[17px] opacity-75 md:block">Sign in with GitHub, install the CLI, first ticket in ten minutes.</p>
        </div>
        <a href="/app/signin" class="inline-flex h-[50px] flex-none items-center justify-center gap-2 rounded-[10px] bg-bg px-6 text-base font-bold text-fg no-underline md:h-[52px]">
          <svg width="18" height="18" viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true" class="fill-current"><path d="M12 .5a11.5 11.5 0 0 0-3.6 22.4c.6.1.8-.3.8-.6v-2c-3.2.7-3.9-1.5-3.9-1.5-.5-1.3-1.3-1.7-1.3-1.7-1-.7.1-.7.1-.7 1.2.1 1.8 1.2 1.8 1.2 1 1.8 2.8 1.3 3.5 1 .1-.8.4-1.3.7-1.6-2.6-.3-5.3-1.3-5.3-5.7 0-1.3.5-2.3 1.2-3.1-.1-.3-.5-1.5.1-3.1 0 0 1-.3 3.2 1.2a11 11 0 0 1 5.8 0c2.2-1.5 3.2-1.2 3.2-1.2.6 1.6.2 2.8.1 3.1.8.8 1.2 1.8 1.2 3.1 0 4.4-2.7 5.4-5.3 5.7.4.4.8 1.1.8 2.2v3.3c0 .3.2.7.8.6A11.5 11.5 0 0 0 12 .5z"></path></svg>
          Start with GitHub
        </a>
      </div>
    </section>
  </main>
</Public>

<script>
  const track = document.getElementById('bento');
  const slides = track ? Array.from(track.querySelectorAll<HTMLElement>(':scope > article')) : [];
  const prev = document.querySelector<HTMLButtonElement>('[data-step="-1"]');
  const next = document.querySelector<HTMLButtonElement>('[data-step="1"]');
  const dots = Array.from(document.querySelectorAll<HTMLElement>('[data-dot]'));
  const pos = document.querySelector<HTMLElement>('[data-pos]');
  const controls = document.querySelector<HTMLElement>('[data-controls]');
  const last = slides.length - 1;

  const snapLeft = (i: number) => {
    if (!track) return 0;
    const pad = parseFloat(getComputedStyle(track).scrollPaddingLeft) || 0;
    const rel = slides[i].getBoundingClientRect().left - track.getBoundingClientRect().left + track.scrollLeft;
    return rel - pad;
  };

  const current = () => {
    if (!track) return 0;
    if (track.scrollLeft <= 1) return 0;
    if (track.scrollLeft + track.clientWidth >= track.scrollWidth - 1) return last;
    let best = 0;
    slides.forEach((_, i) => {
      if (Math.abs(snapLeft(i) - track.scrollLeft) < Math.abs(snapLeft(best) - track.scrollLeft)) best = i;
    });
    return best;
  };

  const sync = () => {
    const i = current();
    if (pos) pos.textContent = String(i + 1);
    if (prev) prev.disabled = i === 0;
    if (next) next.disabled = i === last;
    dots.forEach((d, n) => {
      d.className = `h-1.5 rounded-full ${n === i ? 'w-[18px] bg-accent' : 'w-1.5 bg-line'}`;
    });
  };

  const go = (delta: number) => {
    if (!track) return;
    const max = track.scrollWidth - track.clientWidth;
    // Clamped stops, so a slide that can't reach its snap point never blocks Previous or Next.
    const stops = slides.map((_, i) => (i === 0 ? 0 : i === last ? max : Math.min(max, Math.max(0, snapLeft(i)))));
    const at = track.scrollLeft;
    const left =
      delta > 0
        ? (stops.find((s) => s > at + 1) ?? max)
        : ([...stops].reverse().find((s) => s < at - 1) ?? 0);
    const reduce = matchMedia('(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)').matches;
    track.scrollTo({ left, behavior: reduce ? 'auto' : 'smooth' });
  };

  prev?.addEventListener('click', () => go(-1));
  next?.addEventListener('click', () => go(1));
  track?.addEventListener('scroll', sync, { passive: true });
  controls?.classList.remove('invisible');
  if (track && track.scrollWidth > track.clientWidth) track.tabIndex = 0;
  sync();
</script>
